WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.100
Live class games your students love — and they can build their own.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.350
Pick any subject, any level.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.000
Students join with a code — no accounts.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:23.650
Everyone answers. The race is on!

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.200
Kids describe a game in their own words.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:38.300
The Builder makes it — and plays it to check it works.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.950
Then they play it!

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:52.600
Learning games in 13 languages.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.250
Live class games your students love — and they can build their own. Free for teachers: oomba.ai/teachers/live

